  "title": "Yogurt-Marinated Salmon Fillets (Dahi Machhali Masaledar)",
  "description": "A yogurt-marinated salmon with cayenne pepper, ginger, and garlic. Spice up your fillets before they go under the broiler.",
  "authors": [
    "jpmcminn"
